# slug: ch61-query
# source: chapters/ch61.tex:67
# label: alg:ch61-query
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch61.tex:70
# caption: Demand a query in the current immutable revision.

REQUIRE key q, revision r, pure tracked providers, cache
ENSURE result equal to fresh evaluation in revision r
record q as a dependency of its caller
IF q is an input THEN
  RETURN current input value
END IF
reject a recursive request for an active key
IF q was verified in r THEN
  RETURN cached value
END IF
mark q active
IF an old result exists THEN
  validate old dependencies in read order, stopping at the first changed value
  IF all dependencies are unchanged since the old verification THEN
    set verification stamp to r; unmark q; RETURN old value
  END IF
END IF
run the provider while recording a fresh dependency list
retain the old change stamp if the result is equal; otherwise use r
atomically replace the cached result and dependencies; unmark q
RETURN new value

